# The veil (GEAR.md G4): the drip-warden's core on the back. It lets the drip
# fall ahead: a curtain of water a machine's sight does not pass, twelve
# seconds. A sorter struck at its round backs off to throw; the veil falls
# between it and the player. From above, then over the shoulder, through the
# water at it. Run at a fixed rate, so a frame costs the world no time:
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/veil.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=cloak_vane,mod_veil --give=wick:6,knife:1 --held=knife --config=unharmed
place the_middens
zoom 9
wait 0.6
spawn sorter
try 3
  walkto part 3
  tap swing
  await tell 8
end
tap ability_veil
await ability:veil 5
wait 0.5
shot 01-the-water-falls-between with mob:sorter

tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 1.2
shot 02-over-the-shoulder-through-the-water with shoulder,mob:sorter
